@startuml
' SEQUENCE DIAGRAM B — Skenario Checkout & Pemesanan
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
title **Sequence Diagram — Checkout & Pemesanan**

actor "Anggota\n(Pembeli)"        as U
participant "App Flutter\n(Frontend)"   as App
participant "OrderApiController" as C
participant "Product\n(Model)"   as P
participant "Order\n(Model)"     as O
participant "Payment\n(Model)"   as Pay
database "Database\n(MySQL)"     as DB

autonumber
U -> App : Pilih produk, alamat, voucher/poin, lalu Checkout
App -> C : POST /api/checkout (items, address_id, voucher, points)
C -> P   : cekStok(items)
P -> DB  : SELECT stok FROM products
DB --> P : data stok
P --> C  : status ketersediaan

alt Stok mencukupi
  C -> O   : create(order)
  O -> DB  : INSERT INTO orders + order_items
  DB --> O : success
  C -> P   : decrementStock(items)
  P -> DB  : UPDATE products SET stok = stok - qty
  C -> Pay : create(payment, status='pending')
  Pay -> DB: INSERT INTO payments
  C -> O   : earnPoints(1% subtotal)
  O -> DB  : INSERT INTO point_transactions
  C --> App: HTTP 201 Created (invoice + instruksi bayar)
  App --> U: Tampilkan ringkasan pesanan & pembayaran
else Stok tidak mencukupi
  C --> App: HTTP 422 (stok tidak cukup)
  App --> U: Tampilkan pesan kegagalan
end

note over C, Pay
  Instruksi pembayaran diteruskan ke
  Payment Gateway (QRIS/Transfer);
  callback memperbarui status payment.
end note

caption Gambar 3.6 Sequence Diagram Checkout & Pemesanan
footer Sequence Diagram — SmartMart | Modul Pengguna & Dashboard | Tugas Akhir
@enduml
